Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:07.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hark! Toilet, toilet,\Nwherefore art thou toilet?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:12.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To pee, or not to pee:\Nthat is the question.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:16.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Learning Fusha to chat with people\Nis like learning Shakespeare to find a toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:16.00,OnScreen,,0,0,0,,{\fnNoto Naskh Arabic\fs96}فصحى{\fs70} ≈ Shakespeare
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hikaya teaches the Arabic people actually speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:25.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pick Gulf, Egyptian or Yemeni,\Nand scroll short clips of native speakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:25.00,OnScreen,,0,0,0,,Gulf · Egyptian · Yemeni
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lost on a word? Tap it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:32.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,You get the English, the literal meaning,\Neven how it would look in Fusha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:35.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,One more tap saves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:35.00,OnScreen,,0,0,0,,Tap any word
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:41.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Saved words come back as flashcards\Nright before you'd forget them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:46.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then say it yourself. Shadow the line,\Nget a score, see which sound to fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:51.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stuck? Ask the tutor.\NIt knows which line you're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:51.00,OnScreen,,0,0,0,,Say it. Fix one sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:25.00,Label,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,860)}SCREEN RECORDING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:25.00,LabelSmall,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1000)}Logo, then the home feed.\NTap the dialect pill: Gulf → Egyptian → Yemeni.\NSwipe through three clips.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:35.00,Label,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,860)}SCREEN RECORDING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:35.00,LabelSmall,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1000)}Video player. Tap one word.\NTurn on EN · Literal · Fusha.\NTap "Save to My Words".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:41.00,Label,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,860)}SCREEN RECORDING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:41.00,LabelSmall,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1000)}/review: the saved word as a flashcard.\NFlip it, rate "Good".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:51.00,Label,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,860)}SCREEN RECORDING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:51.00,LabelSmall,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1000)}Shadow tab (non-TikTok clip): repeat the line,\Nscore appears, one sound highlighted.\NThen "Ask" on that line.
